   },
   {
    "part": "quotes",
    "text": "writes:"
   },
   {
    "part": "quotes",
    "text": ">How much can you tell about a person's health by looking into their"
   },
   {
    "part": "body",
    "text": "eyes?"
   },
   {
    "part": "body",
    "text": ""
   },
   {
    "part": "body",
    "text": "By looking at the iris (iridology) - virtually nothing."
   },
   {
    "part": "body",
    "text": ""
   },
   {
    "part": "body",
    "text": "Looking at the retina allows one to visualise the small blood"
   },
   {
    "part": "body",
    "text": "vessels and is helpful in assessing various systemic diseases,"
   },
   {
    "part": "body",
    "text": "hypertension and diabetes for example."
   },
